	// SecurityApprovalKeys The approval keys of the Organization's admins (capability security.approval-keys, ADR-0054 Decisions 4 and 11): for each live admin, how many of their passkeys are trusted and how many unconfirmed, when one was last confirmed, and each passkey's name, provenance and dates. Only a trusted passkey can give a step-up approval. Never a passkey's credential id, public key or counter, and no passkey ids. Read-only. Needs organization.manage; existence-hiding. Never cached.
